Y Combinator company data

yc_all.json is a pinned snapshot of Y Combinator's free public OSS companies API,
fetched 2026-08-14 (6,168 companies). That data is YC's, not mine, and the MIT
grant above does not extend to it. It is pinned rather than re-fetched because the
live API changes, and re-fetching would silently change which 120 companies the
stratified draw selects and invalidate the labels.

labels.csv, RUBRIC.md and icp_eval.csv are my own work and are covered by LICENSE.
